mongo-cxx-driver
------------------------------------------
C++ Driver for MongoDB

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbson2_2-2.5.7-1bl2
  libbsoncxx1-devel-4.6.1-1bl1
  libbsoncxx1_1-4.6.1-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libmongoc2_2-2.5.7-1bl2
  libmongocxx1-devel-4.6.1-1bl1
  libmongocxx1_1-4.6.1-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libCatch2-devel-3.16.1-1bl1
  libbson2-devel-2.5.7-1bl2
  libmongoc2-devel-2.5.7-1bl2
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/mongodb/mongo-cxx-driver

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/mongodb/mongo-cxx-driver/archive/refs/tags/r4.6.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack mongo-cxx-driver-4.6.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./mongo-cxx-driver-4.6.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/mongo-cxx-driver-4.6.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/mongo-cxx-driver-4.6.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmongocxx1_1-4.6.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmongocxx1-devel-4.6.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbsoncxx1_1-4.6.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libbsoncxx1-devel-4.6.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

